$ jailops jail create web --image freebsd-151 --network lan --storage default --start
jail/web created
jail/web started

$ jailops expose web 80 --host-port 8080
jail/web exposed: 80/tcp
  IPv4  10.20.0.10   forwarded: host 8080->80 (NAT)

$ jailops list
NAME   STATE     OS        IMAGE         GEN   ADDRESSES    EXPOSED         AUTOSTART   USED   AGE
web    running   freebsd   freebsd-151   g1    10.20.0.10   8080→80/tcp 4   -           -      3h

$ jailops firewall show web
Policies of jail/web: none (the host answers ping and DNS only)

Reaches jail/web

SOURCE     FAMILY   PROTO   PORTS   LIMITED TO   REACH               BY
Internet   4        tcp     80      any          forward host:8080   expose

The jail reaches (default out: allow (no policy says deny))
  Internet:       all
  Host:           DNS and ping
  Other jails:    all
  Other projects: none

attach one: jailops firewall policy attach POLICY web

$ jailops firewall show web -o json
{
  "project": "main",
  "jail": "web",
  "rows": [
    {
      "source": "internet",
      "family": "4",
      "proto": "tcp",
      "ports": "80",
      "from": [
        "any"
      ],
      "decision": "forward",
      "by": "expose",
      "host_port": 8080
    }
  ],
  "exposed": [
    {
      "proto": "tcp",
      "ports": "80",
      "family": "4",
      "address": "10.20.0.10",
      "host_port": 8080,
      "from": [
        "any"
      ],
      "restricted": false,
      "via": "forward",
      "by": "expose"
    }
  ],
  "out": {
    "internet": "all",
    "host": "DNS and ping",
    "jails": "all",
    "other_projects": "none"
  },
  "default_in": "allow",
  "default_out": "allow",
  "rules": []
}

$ jailops firewall exposed
JAIL   PROTO   PORTS   FAMILY   ADDRESS                   FROM   BY
web    tcp     80      v4       host:8080 -> 10.20.0.10   any    expose

$ jailops firewall exposed --tunnels
JAIL   PROTO   PORTS   FAMILY   ADDRESS                   FROM   BY
web    tcp     80      v4       host:8080 -> 10.20.0.10   any    expose

From WireGuard tunnels
Nothing is reachable from a tunnel.

$ jailops firewall show nobody
! not_found: jail "nobody" not found
! hint: list them with 'jailops jail list'; check --project, --host and --remote too
[exit 4]

